  #line-at(159.86pt, 392.33pt, "- graphene and Co-Co nonlocal spin valve, the constricted/notched FGT-Co spin valve ")
  #line-at(57.36pt, 412.49pt, "shows a clear ST spin injection, besides the normal SD counterpart. Furthermore, the spin injection ")
  #line-at(57.36pt, 432.67pt, "efficiency of SD and ST was also evaluated from the spin valve signal (Supplementary Note 3 and Table S1). ")
  #line-at(57.36pt, 452.71pt, "It shows that both SD and ST have comparable spin injection efficiency P")
